Z||000000||hugh||07-23-2000||12:14 PM||||I have a Harwood scoop and wing on my 88GT.Man is it heavy.There was no support for the hood except for a piece of 2x4(looks real professionally done,yea right)I got a support for the front trunk on Ebay cheap,and used it to support the engine cover.It took about 2 hours to figure out how to best use it and mount it,but it works great and looks like a factory original. I should mention that because of the scoop my cover cannot go as high as a normal(scoopless) lid.<p>[This message has been edited by hugh (edited 07-23-2000).]||||reg||1
